    {
      "id": "claim_54d182b938f24c909ef90270e840085f",
      "statement": "The portable skill bundle format requires a UTF-8 SKILL.md with YAML frontmatter (name 1-64 lowercase-kebab, description 1-1024 chars, no aliases/duplicate keys) plus 1-128 portable relative files, each at most 512 KiB and the whole bundle at most 2 MiB; the shared validator in packages/strap/src/skills/bundle.ts (validateSkillBundle, validateSkillName, validateSkillPath, encodeSkillFile, fileBytes, canonicalSkillContent) is used by the CLI, browser editor, and server.",
